tor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OMAE, MITSUHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A driver IC includes a first driver section for supplying driving signals to n output terminals and a second driver section for selectively switching one of m selection terminals (m &gt;/= 3) to a predetermined potential. The first driver section includes a timing control circuit that provides a timing signal for the second driver section to perform the selective switching. The timing control circuit generates the timing signal based on external control signals supplied through a number of signal lines less than m.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un pilote sur circuit imprimé réunissant un premier élément pilote délivrant des signaux d'attaque sur n bornes de sortie et un second élément pilote commutant sélectivement à un potentiel déterminé l'une des m bornes de sélection (m &gt;/= 3). Le premier élément pilote comporte un circuit de commande de synchronisation délivrant un signal de synchronisation permettant au second élément pilote d'exécuter la commutation sélective. Pour générer le signal de synchronisation, le circuit de commande de synchronisation s'appuie sur des signaux de synchronisation externes fournis via un nombre de lignes de signal inférieur à m.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>